mat="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI, KAZUAKI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HIROKAWA TOSHIYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MARUZENI SHOJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI KAZUAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HIROKAWA, TOSHIYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MARUZENI, SHOJI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUZUKI, KAZUAKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Vegetable sterol-containing fat compositions which contain: (A) vegetable sterol fatty acid esters; and (B) from 10 to 70 % by weight of partial glycerides. The compositions can impart an effect of regulating the absorption of cholesterol. When these compositions are used in producing fat foods of emulsion type (margarines, fat spreads, whipped creams, etc.), it is possible to use no emulsifier or to reduce the amount of emulsifiers, thereby giving emulsion products having no or relieved smell characteristic to emulsifiers.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne des compositions de graisses végétales stérolées comprenant (A) des esters d'acides gras stérolés végétaux et (B) de 10 % à 70 % en masse de glycérides partiels. Ces compositions sont susceptibles de conférer un effet régulateur de l'absorption du cholestérol. L'utilisation de ces compositions pour la production de produits alimentaires gras de type émulsion, tels que les margarines, pâtes à tartiner, crèmes fouettées, permet de se dispenser totalement ou partiellement des émulsifiants, ce qui permet l'obtention de produits d'émulsion ne présentant absolument ou sensiblement aucune caractéristique olfactive.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>